{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45626","headline":"拟齐梁体寄冯使君三首 一 · 贯休","name":"拟齐梁体寄冯使君三首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"庭鸟多好音，相呼灌木中。\n竹房更何有，还如鸟巢空。\n赖逢富人侯，真东晋谢公。\n煌煌发令姿，珂佩鸣丁冬。\n故山有深霞，未如旌旗红。\n惭非卫霍松，何以当清风。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45626.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45626","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}